{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4001_015siz", "source_sha256": "9a87052cef069e58d7e86fce72455c0866d01330162f2052a5c010a63aae39f4", "ja": "{$P$}、ちょっといいですか？\n次のミュージカルのオーディションなんですけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}，可以打扰一下吗？\n有关于下次音乐剧的试镜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4002_p", "source_sha256": "5f68511a93286b88d275a3323b152865af436b127e932abb010bc00437d9c730", "ja": "ああ、もうすぐだな。\nどの役を受けるか決めたか？　静香。", "zh": "嗯，就快到了啊。\n静香，你决定好要试镜哪个角色了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4003_015siz", "source_sha256": "ac2ef7e474235b8e2af3be2d7e6843e1d5e7aefc87cae6537a9140028011f43d", "ja": "いえ、まだ……。なので、{$P$}の\n意見を聞いてみようかと……その、参考までに。", "zh": "不，还没……因此，我想问问{$P$}的\n意见……那个，当作是参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4004_015siz", "source_sha256": "05f9280c0e57d42e9d6431bda59f1f6c53d50d7eca2cb66f720261f479bb6424", "ja": "私、このお仕事、絶対に受かりたいんです。\nこの仕事に受かれば、アイドルとしても、きっと……。", "zh": "我无论如何都希望能接下这份工作。\n如果能接下这份工作，我想自己作为偶像一定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4005_015siz", "source_sha256": "7f0e36b592a6288e8f1e51848a57c669e74a277c44a854da4a96147d6f47592f", "ja": "きっと、一歩前に進めると思うんです。\nだから……お願いします！", "zh": "一定也能更向前迈进一步。\n所以……麻烦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4006", "source_sha256": "da513b67daf95bb25c6c39c47a1187ed8977b5e803e6c9179460a26927cccb0a", "ja": "ソロパートのある侍女", "zh": "有独唱演出的侍女", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4007", "source_sha256": "671a341b006161ba33df51c713fec929b949c43a9b649b9fca89283c3e96f66b", "ja": "コメディリリーフの\n道化師", "zh": "缓和气氛的小丑", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4008", "source_sha256": "3b57946c07ef7f793720ecdc2b8896c82863c3a7d3eada82bdd0efc2ba11ca56", "ja": "主役の歌姫", "zh": "女主角歌姬", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4100_p", "source_sha256": "4adb66712698d3a163fd61a8bfeebf49a2858305785a03cf1f1cf6e735fd4a9e", "ja": "そうだな……脇役ではあるけど、\nこの侍女の役がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "这个嘛……虽然是个配角，\n但这个侍女应该不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4101_015siz", "source_sha256": "8e00622c8928ef7886967998ddf3a1dd08746613b492380d3138a559ce562f91", "ja": "侍女……ですか。\nでも、ちょっと出番が少なくありませんか？", "zh": "侍女……是吗。\n但是，这角色出场的次数不会有点太少吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4102_p", "source_sha256": "c2d8c471da8a118ba113b715473709554247de82b95264ca28aaa322e77ddec8", "ja": "いや。セリフは少ないが、歌にソロパートがある。\nここに力を入れれば、好印象を残せると思うんだ。", "zh": "不，虽然台词不多，但是歌曲里有她的独唱。\n只要在这里多用点心，应该能留下好印象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4103_p", "source_sha256": "50fc4448b75b4bbd7b31f69dc25626eefc71d9b2a63d44fc4b9e516381a822cb", "ja": "それに、常に主演の側に控えている役だから、\n出番も多いし。", "zh": "而且，这是经常待在主角身旁的角色，\n所以出场机会也很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4104_015siz", "source_sha256": "774df784db4507c21bebf981365fe228fcfbbb030655e0a22368624a681f09a2", "ja": "確かに……私、演技にはまだあまり自信がないし。\n何もかも、一度にこなそうとするよりは……。", "zh": "的确……我对演技也还不是很有自信。\n与其想一步登天，这样或许更好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4105_015siz", "source_sha256": "523917d326401a4c68d5fce43aceff00448547ae2c6e5e6c13321f497cf1398c", "ja": "……うん。\n今の私には、うってつけの役かも……！", "zh": "……嗯。\n对现在的我来说，这或许就是最适合的角色……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4106_015siz", "source_sha256": "dcc0c749db4048eb64b124586cd1f7d4727c77c1cf13c79f5bcdf955bbdacdc6", "ja": "あっ……い、今のは、独り言ですからね！\nあくまで、参考にするだけですから！！", "zh": "啊……刚、刚才是我自言自语！\n这个说到底只是作为参考而已！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4200_p", "source_sha256": "df275745018076ac77c6c1a3ef540a3a2306bb0609a2f3f0c9c94245f9afa684", "ja": "ここはひとつ、コメディリリーフの\n道化師役にチャレンジするのはどうだ？", "zh": "这次就干脆挑战\n缓和气氛的小丑如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4201_015siz", "source_sha256": "4195a9d3fc8d3c0ef3ac6be2d5ac00b18f32b3802ae0eec9e5c6f2d38108ac8e", "ja": "ど、道化師！？　確かに目立ちますけど、\nでもこれ、歌がない役ですよね……？", "zh": "小、小丑！？这角色的确很引人注目，\n但是，这是个不需要唱歌的角色吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4202_p", "source_sha256": "20c4ba1ed77c5ecd23aedf7a01f9e080467fec8ec1b79e0cd1d4f5728e30f2bb", "ja": "静香やアイドルのイメージからはだいぶ離れているな。\nだからこそ、学べるものがあるんじゃないか？", "zh": "这角色与静香以及偶像的形象是差满多的。\n但正因为如此，才有值得学习的地方不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4203_015siz", "source_sha256": "f84dd8309d69af6569f1a317111aa9a6a39a01c95a1902bc3057dfb5eaa11421", "ja": "そ、そうですね……。\n新しいことに挑戦するのも、大事かもしれません。", "zh": "说、说得也是……\n挑战新事物或许也很重要呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4204_015siz", "source_sha256": "f491c25b9326230af101592eb64e3bb10ba371d015492fd25ae63d658a3b6c02", "ja": "それじゃ……こほん。「道化師を、どう消した？」\nあの、{$P$}。笑っていいんですよ？", "zh": "那么……咳咳。「小丑笑丑了？」\n那个，{$P$}。你可以笑出来没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4300_p", "source_sha256": "9f2a4958dd3017afd01315e94f070ae5053a9361b024b961e8436f0873a14206", "ja": "そうか。ならここは、思いきって\n主役の歌姫を狙ってみるべきじゃないか？", "zh": "这样啊，那这次就干脆放手一搏，\n以女主角歌姬为目标如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4301_015siz", "source_sha256": "d45dc2e5ddfb8758bb09aa581d2c04ac060af5ac2162b86d1a626f0e6d4e6dbf", "ja": "えっ……い、いきなり主役ですか？\nでも、今の私の実力じゃ、難しいような……。", "zh": "咦……一、一开始就挑战主角吗？\n但是，凭我现在的实力，恐怕很困难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_4302_015siz", "source_sha256": "e99ac91726cb12865f6d0382cf727537c376fd41104e04d8078aedd4175053a9", "ja": "推してくれたこと自体は嬉しいですけど……\n私、そこまでうぬぼれてませんよ。", "zh": "虽然你推荐我去试，让我很开心……\n但是我并没有这么自以为是喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
